 listen to this Qur’ān and speak noisily during [the recitation of] it that perhaps you will overcome.\"","j":24,"h":48,"s":41,"a":26,"sd":null},{"k":"41:27","t":"But We will surely cause those who disbelieve to taste a severe punishment, and We will surely recompense them for the worst of what they had been doing.","j":24,"h":48,"s":41,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"41:28","t":"That is the recompense of the enemies of Allāh - the Fire. For them therein is the home of eternity as recompense for what they, of Our verses, were rejecting.","j":24,"h":48,"s":41,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"41:29","t":"And those who disbelieved will [then] say, \"Our Lord, show us those who misled us of the jinn and men [so] we may put them under our feet that they will be among the lowest.\"","j":24,"h":48,"s":41,"a":29,"sd":null}],"juz":24,"hizb":48,"surahs":[41],"sajdah":false}